  "body": "> An element implementing the HTMLHyperlinkElementUtils mixin has an associated set the url algorithm, which sets this element's url to the resulting URL record of parsing this element's href content attribute value relative to this element's node document. If parsing was aborted with an error, set this element's url to null.\n\nI believe it should set the element's url to null. But instead it tries to parse the nonexistent content attribute.\n",
